NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-28 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Mr. Vincent, it's your turn to give the speech.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.580
Get out of my way!

3
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:17.670
Evelyn, wait for me, you must not be hurt!

4
00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:19.670
Beautiful.

5
00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:23.670
Evelyn, the first time I saw you, I thought you looked just like Isidandra.

6
00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:26.670
Of course I do. She raised me.

7
00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:30.670
But you're ungrateful! How dare you betray me?

8
00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:33.670
I haven't even touched you after all these years!

9
00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:37.670
Because you're incompetent, aren't you? You're not even a man.

10
00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:43.620
You want to provoke me? But what good will that do you?

11
00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:46.620
If you'd been obedient, we could have enjoyed the entire Heart Man and together.

12
00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:49.620
It's you! It's you! You wasted all of this!

13
00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:53.620
No, Arthur. You're a criminal. I'll never side with you.

14
00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:57.620
What are you looking at? Do you really think my son will come to save you?

15
00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:58.620
Of course he will.

16
00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:05.370
Evelyn, he's a heart too. All hearts are heartless.

17
00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:14.780
Look, you two are nothing alike.
